scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn6bRE8plS5aoj9ZxlWbWVGc1QLSDcThC5CNGKC7rAIw&oe=6B03330C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Scary Free", "keywords": ["horror", "survival", "escape", "multiplayer", "sandbox"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udca5**Afraid of Ghosts? It's Okay!** In **Scary Free**, even **the timid** can become **ghost-busting heroes!** Your job is super simple: find the ghost, figure out what's going on, and lock it away before it gets you!\n\n\ud83d\udc7b**Play with up to 3 Friends**: Look for clues, hide from spooky ghosts, and solve puzzles. It's **scary**...but also super fun.\n\n\ud83c\udfae**Use Cool, Real-Feelings Tools**: Pick up ringing phones, throw water, pull switches, and listen to creepy seashells. Every move feels **real and intense**. \n\n\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f**Watch for Ghost Signs**: Ghostly screams, shaking walls, bleeding pipes, phones ringing by themselves\u2026 **spooky stuff** is everywhere.\n\n\ud83c\udfad**Unlock Outfits and Power-Ups**: wear a Freddy mask, take a pill to look like a ghost. Each level-up brings **new tools** and **deeper gameplay**.\n\n\ud83c\udf10**Join the Community**: Make your own **ghost-fighting style**, and share it with others in our Discord.\n\n", "short_description": "Afraid of Ghosts? It's Okay! In Scary Free, even the timid can become ghost-busting heroes! Your job is super simple: find the ghost, figure out what's going on, and lock it away before it gets you!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://scaryfree.com/privacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Joy Inventor", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://scaryfree.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "